# Directed regression manifest -- read by run.sh.
#
#   <name> spike  [+PLUSARG...]                          full-trace compare vs <name>.ref
#   <name> expect <reg>=<hex>... [-- +PLUSARG...]        DUT only (deliberate divergence)
#
# Every .S in this directory must appear here. Memory timing matters: fixed
# waits, random waits, zero waits and garbage not-ready data each expose
# different bugs, so the stall-sensitive tests run under several.

