# Destinations that are also sources (AMOs, LR/SC, loads into their base),
# read-after-write across every EX stall, the fetch PMP check cycles, the write
# landing on the next reader's capture edge for every way an instruction names
# its registers (32-bit formats and each compressed form), and x0 everywhere.
